<% layout('/layouts/boilerplate') -%>
<body>
  <div class="info-hero">
    <h1>Reduce, Reuse, Recycle</h1>
    <p>Together, let's build a cleaner, greener tomorrow.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="info-section">
    <!-- Why Recycle Card -->
    <div class="info-card">
      <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/128/2913/2913461.png" alt="Earth Recycling Icon" />
      <h2>Why Recycle?</h2>
      <p>Every item we recycle is a step toward preserving our planet's health. Here's how:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Conserve Resources:</strong> Recycling paper saves trees; recycling metals uses up to 95% less energy than mining new ore.</li>
        <li><strong>Reduce Pollution:</strong> Less extraction means cleaner air and water for all species.</li>
        <li><strong>Save Energy:</strong> Producing goods from recycled materials uses 40% less energy on average compared to virgin materials.</li>
        <li><strong>Lower Carbon Footprint:</strong> Recycling reduces greenhouse gas emissions—critical in combating climate change.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- How to Recycle Effectively Card -->
    <div class="info-card">
      <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/128/2305/2305889.png" alt="Sorting Bins Icon" />
      <h2>How to Recycle Effectively</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Clean & Dry:</strong> Rinse containers to prevent contamination.</li>
        <li><strong>Know Your Symbols:</strong> Look for ♻️ codes on plastics (#1–#7) and sort accordingly.</li>
        <li><strong>Separate Right:</strong> Paper, glass, metal, and e-waste each need their own streams.</li>
        <li><strong>Break Down Boxes:</strong> Flatten cardboard to save space and improve collection efficiency.</li>
      </ol>
      <p>Tip: Keep a small bin in your kitchen and a larger one by your garage for easy sorting!</p>
    </div>

    <!-- The Future of Recycling Card -->
    <div class="info-card">
      <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/128/2734/2734627.png" alt="Robotic Sorting Icon" />
      <h2>The Future of Recycling</h2>
      <p>Cutting-edge ideas are revolutionizing waste management:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Chemical Recycling:</strong> Converts plastics back into basic building blocks for infinite reuse.</li>
        <li><strong>AI-Powered Sorters:</strong> Smart robots identify and sort materials faster and more accurately than humans.</li>
        <li><strong>Circular Design:</strong> Products engineered for disassembly and full material recovery.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>By supporting these innovations today, we unlock a zero-waste economy for future generations.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Common Recyclables Card -->
    <div class="info-card">
      <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/128/556/556839.png" alt="Recyclable Materials Icon" />
      <h2>Common Recyclables</h2>
      <p>Most communities accept these everyday items:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Paper: Newspapers, office paper, cardboard</li>
        <li>Plastics: Bottles, jugs, certain films (check local rules)</li>
        <li>Glass: Bottles and jars (clear, green, brown)</li>
        <li>Metals: Aluminum cans, tin containers, scrap metal</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Check with your local facility for specialty items like electronics, batteries, and light bulbs.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Recycling Impact Statistics Card -->
    <div class="info-card">
      <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/128/1006/1006771.png" alt="Statistics Icon" />
      <h2>Global Recycling Impact</h2>
      <p>Did you know?</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Over 75% of all waste can be recycled or composted, yet only 30% is diverted from landfills.</li>
        <li>The U.S. recycles 35 million tons of plastic annually, saving 45 million barrels of oil.</li>
        <li>Recycling one aluminum can saves enough energy to run a TV for 3 hours.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Imagine the collective impact if every community reached 50% recycling rates by 2030!</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="cta-card">
      <h2>Get Involved</h2>
      <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/128/18616/18616615.png" alt="Community Icon" />
      <p>Join our <a href="/community">RecycleConnect Community</a> to share tips, find local events, and team up for cleanups.</p>
      <p>Together, we become the change-makers of a greener world. 🌎💚</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2025 RecycleConnect</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>